    {"id":"p0-5y","type":"text","text":"## 0.5Y ✅ INPUT SELECTION\nNo new Life Brain input • consistency belongs to athlete performance\nRatings define talent • consistency controls game-to-game variance • $0","x":-650,"y":5380,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-6a","type":"text","text":"## 0.6A ✅ OPT-IN CONSISTENCY PILOT\n1 elite • 4 steady • 5 normal • 2 volatile active athletes\n80 games • 47 score + 12 winner differences • exact replay • 53/53 tests • $0","x":-650,"y":5590,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-6b","type":"text","text":"## 0.6B ✅ CALIBRATION • NOT ELIGIBLE\n4,000 same-athlete games + exact replays • mean talent + balance pass\nElite 19.2% vs volatile 19.3% bad nights • same 14-point floor • rollout blocked","x":-650,"y":5800,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"p0-6c","type":"text","text":"## 0.6C ✅ RESOLVER REDESIGN REVIEW\nOpt-in v2 shooting ledger • rating-based expectation • bounded correction\nNo runtime change • preserve bad + exceptional nights • $0","x":-650,"y":6010,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
